    <profile name="The Lion Helm" id="2add-fd61-ef94-3a08" hidden="false" page="78" publicationId="308f-63b0-ee37-1c6b" typeId="4657-2671-1065-d493" typeName="Armour">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Saving Throw" typeId="b439-323a-9cfe-6340">4+</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Special" typeId="b7f1-73cd-d19d-26a6">Any model within 3&quot; of the bearer can gain this save. The 4+ save is unmodifiable by any attacks that originate from outside the bubble. If the attacker is within the bubble this save does not apply.
If another model with a personal field is within the bubble they must choose which field save to use.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Ezekiel " id="4fac-30e7-7057-6013" hidden="false" page="80" publicationId="308f-63b0-ee37-1c6b" typeId="219f-0faa-a2d8-f766" typeName="Unit">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Unit Type" typeId="49de-956f-8797-7436">Ezekiel</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="M" typeId="4934-7872-3dd7-a8b6">4</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="WS" typeId="dc18-b600-96a9-a4a3">7</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="BS" typeId="f859-88a3-fdd3-b298">7</characteristic>
